 * @file /std/object/value.lpc
 *
 * Handles monetary value tracking for physical objects.
 *
 * @created 2024-08-01 - Gesslar
 * @last_modified 2025-03-16 - GitHub Copilot
 *
 * @history
 * 2024-08-01 - Gesslar - Created
